        "title": "Elia Nuqul Fellowship Network",
        "slug": "elia-nuqul-fellowship-network",
        "articleHtml": "<p>Previous and current scholars connect, bond and network through the<strong> </strong>ENF Fellowship Network<strong>.</strong> Fellows support<span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span>each other by coaching, mentoring each other and sharing experiences.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>This ongoing effort to create a tightly-knit strong society of successful individuals helps promote a sense of duty and belonging towards the community, where giving back is the number-one priority.</p>",
